fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsink.html#gst_app_sink_simple_callbacks_set_new_event","fragment":"\n\tgst_app_sink_simple_callbacks_set_new_event\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkSimpleCallbacks.prototype.set_new_event\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkSimpleCallbacks.set_new_event\n\nSets the new event callback on cb.\nOnce cb is set on an GstAppSink it is not possible anymore to change any of\nthe callbacks inside it.\nParameters:\nthe callbacks\nnew event callback\nthe user data\nGDestroyNotify to free the user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nSets the new event callback on cb.\nOnce cb is set on an GstApp.AppSink it is not possible anymore to change any of\nthe callbacks inside it.\nParameters:\nthe callbacks\nnew event callback\nthe user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nSets the new event callback on cb.\nOnce cb is set on an GstApp.AppSink it is not possible anymore to change any of\nthe callbacks inside it.\nParameters:\nthe callbacks\nnew event callback\nthe user data\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});